.TH passive 1 "Writer's ScriptBench"
.SH Name
passive \- show basic passive constructs
.SH Synopsis
.I passive
.IR files ...
.SH Description
.I passive
displays basic passive phrases
in the named
.IR files .
Examples include 
.I "is not specified"
and
.IR "are separated" .
.LP
This utility does not flag more complex
passive constructions,
but should give you a good start
for eliminating the most common
passive phrases.
.SH Bugs
.I passive won't find phrases
broken across lines.
